    "body": "@mbgower understood your points,  re: a closed tab ring - there's this issue https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7707 - where this commentary would be more applicable.\r\n\r\nre: light dismiss, that's something people do now with JS for modal/non-modal dialogs - where a mouse click or tap outside of the dialog can close it.  but this issue isn't saying that people would _have_ to do that, because `popover=manual` could be used instead which does not have the light dismiss behavior as a default.",
