    "body": "Before we seriously think about deprecating `show()` I think there is more work to be done to ensure adding/removing the `open` attribute functions to a similar (or even sensible) degree. I think this issue is somewhat dependant on, for example, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10953, https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10954, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10982, and we should likely settle on https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8625, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9044, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10171, https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10708 to name a few.",
